WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.598
Welcome to our overview of the Growth Opportunities tool.

00:00:03.598 --> 00:00:10.393
After setting up your business and adding products to your catalog, it can be challenging to know

00:00:10.393 --> 00:00:14.390
which Amazon tools to leverage to help grow your business.

00:00:14.390 --> 00:00:19.987
The Growth Opportunities tool is geared to help you identify the business objectives, programs,

00:00:19.987 --> 00:00:23.185
and tasks most likely to impact your performance.

00:00:23.185 --> 00:00:29.580
It provides a personalized experience for you to prioritize actions at the ASIN level by identifying

00:00:29.580 --> 00:00:33.855
recommendations that are unique to you and your products.

00:00:33.855 --> 00:00:40.707
To access the tool, hover over Growth and select Growth Opportunities from the Seller Central main

00:00:40.707 --> 00:00:41.135
menu.

00:00:41.135 --> 00:00:47.988
Here, you'll discover ways to increase an ASIN's conversion or sales, reduce costs to operate, or

00:00:47.988 --> 00:00:50.129
improve traffic, and drive discoverability.

00:00:50.129 --> 00:00:56.982
Our recommendations are based on a number of factors, like our assessment of your product's sales

00:00:56.982 --> 00:01:03.837
potential, or the sales lift other sellers experienced after following the recommendation on a similar

00:01:03.837 --> 00:01:04.266
product.

00:01:04.266 --> 00:01:11.551
Browse your top 50 opportunities or select an opportunity category on the left side of the page

00:01:11.551 --> 00:01:14.980
to view a recommendation by goal or type.

00:01:14.980 --> 00:01:19.921
Categories include, sell new products, improve sales, reduce cost, and drive traffic.

00:01:19.921 --> 00:01:27.333
You can also create a custom ASIN list, which helps you bundle products of a certain type, such

00:01:27.333 --> 00:01:28.980
as color or category.

00:01:28.980 --> 00:01:37.980
We rank your recommendations for you by evaluating the estimated effect and relevance to your products.

00:01:37.980 --> 00:01:41.980
The ranking order is personalized to each seller.

00:01:41.980 --> 00:01:46.980
You can find all recommendations ranked under the Rank column.

00:01:46.980 --> 00:01:50.980
Click on a recommendation to see ASIN's with that recommendation.

00:01:50.980 --> 00:01:57.980
For example, when you click Create Sponsored Products Ad under Drive Traffic Recommendations, we'll

00:01:57.980 --> 00:02:01.980
suggest keywords to use when creating your campaign.

00:02:01.980 --> 00:02:06.980
Click Review and Launch in Ads Console to take action.

00:02:06.980 --> 00:02:13.241
ASIN's with a High Value or HV badge can help you prioritize which ASIN's to improve.

00:02:13.241 --> 00:02:15.980
Hover over the badge to learn more.

00:02:15.980 --> 00:02:23.063
You can hover over a column title to review each metric's definition or click the column titles

00:02:23.063 --> 00:02:25.980
to sort by ascending or descending order.

00:02:25.980 --> 00:02:32.266
One of these metrics is Impact, which represents the potential sales lift you could have earned

00:02:32.266 --> 00:02:36.980
if you'd taken the recommended action on that ASIN 90 days prior.

00:02:36.980 --> 00:02:44.806
To inform this estimate, we use your sales performance for the ASIN and any actual sales lifts experienced

00:02:44.806 --> 00:02:46.980
by sellers selling similar products.

00:02:46.980 --> 00:02:53.980
Click the Impact metric within each recommendation and a pop-up window will open with more information.

00:02:53.980 --> 00:03:01.480
Impact metrics vary by category and include likelihood of sale, net proceeds gain, potential sales

00:03:01.480 --> 00:03:03.980
lift and potential traffic lift.

00:03:03.980 --> 00:03:09.980
Click the button featured below a recommendation to go to the page where you can complete the action.

00:03:09.980 --> 00:03:13.980
Note that the button's call to action will depend on the recommendation.

00:03:13.980 --> 00:03:20.980
You can read about an opportunity and how it could benefit you by clicking "Why this recommendation?"

00:03:20.980 --> 00:03:26.980
But also select Snooze to hide an opportunity for one month, making room for another.

00:03:26.980 --> 00:03:31.980
Click Provide Feedback on any recommendation to share your feedback with Amazon.

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:38.499
To provide more general feedback or request a new feature for the Growth Opportunities tool, select

00:03:38.499 --> 00:03:42.980
Rate This Page at the top of the Growth Opportunities page.

00:03:42.980 --> 00:03:47.980
In certain cases, we'll share multiple recommendations for a single ASIN.

00:03:47.980 --> 00:03:52.980
Use the Search by ASIN field to search and select an ASIN.

00:03:52.980 --> 00:03:59.862
Then review these recommendations and act on the ones you'd like to take, or select View All ASIN

00:03:59.862 --> 00:04:05.980
Opportunities below the ASIN to see all of the ways you could improve that ASIN's performance.

00:04:05.980 --> 00:04:11.980
Recommended actions are projected to have the greatest impact for a particular ASIN.

00:04:11.980 --> 00:04:17.458
For more information on the types of opportunities that the Growth Opportunities tool provides,

00:04:17.458 --> 00:04:20.980
select Learn More About Growth Opportunities from the menu.

00:04:20.980 --> 00:04:25.980
Then, click Opportunity Types to select and review each category.

00:04:25.980 --> 00:04:32.296
We also recommend selecting metrics to learn more about the key performance indicators the tool

00:04:32.296 --> 00:04:33.980
can assess for you.

00:04:33.980 --> 00:04:36.980
Your top 50 opportunities are updated daily.

00:04:36.980 --> 00:04:43.980
Check back as often as you'd like to locate and act on the ones that matter most to your business.

00:04:43.980 --> 00:04:47.980
This concludes our training on the Growth Opportunities tool.

00:04:47.980 --> 00:04:51.980
Thank you and happy selling in the Amazon store.
